r] them blazing fire.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":97,"sd":null},{"k":"17:98","t":"That is their recompense because they disbelieved in Our verses and said, \"When we are bones and crumbled particles, will we [truly] be resurrected [in] a new creation?\"","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":98,"sd":null},{"k":"17:99","t":"Do they not see that Allāh, who created the heavens and earth, is [the one] Able to create the likes of them? And He has appointed for them a term, about which there is no doubt. But the wrongdoers refuse except disbelief.","j":15,"h":30,"s":17,"a":99,"sd":null},{"k":"17:100","t":"Say [to them], \"If you possessed the depositories of the mercy of my Lord, then you would withhold out of fear of spending.\" And ever has man been stingy.","j":15,"h":30,"s":17,"a":100,"sd":null},{"k":"17:101","t":"And We had certainly given Moses nine evident signs, so ask the Children of Israel [about] when he came to them and Pharaoh said to him, \"Indeed I think, O Moses, that you are affected by magic.\"","j":15,"h":30,"s":17,"a":101,"sd":null},{"k":"17:102","t":"[Moses] said, \"You have already known that none has sent down these [signs] except the Lord of the heavens and the earth as evidence, and indeed I think, O Pharaoh, that you are destroyed.\"","j":15,"h":30,"s":17,"a":102,"sd":null},{"k":"17:103","t":"So he intended to drive them from the land, but We drowned him and those with him all together.","j":15,"h":30,"s":17,"a":103,"sd":null},{"k":"17:104","t":"And We said after him [i.e., Pharaoh] to the Children of Israel, \"Dwell in the land, and when there comes the promise [i.e., appointment] of the Hereafter, We will bring you forth in [one] gathering.\"","j":15,"h":30,"s":17,"a":104,"sd":null}],"juz":15,"hizb":29,"surahs":[17],"sajdah":false}